{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>On the shore of the Forgotten Island, a lost puppet wakes up.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast away by The Hand, the entity that once guided her, she will have to make her way up to the top of the mountain in order to find a way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945720/extras/146f30b26e002abf0ba4b59b359b1a29.poster.avif?t=1756846917\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945720/extras/146f30b26e002abf0ba4b59b359b1a29.webm?t=1756846917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945720/extras/146f30b26e002abf0ba4b59b359b1a29.mp4?t=1756846917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freely discover a small open world island at your own pace!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole island is there for you to explore. You can walk, jump, find and unlock shortcuts, and discover hidden places all around it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make new friends and unveil a charming and emotional story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many characters inhabit the Forgotten Island, meet them all, learn their stories and do your best to give a helping hand. Who knows, maybe they can teach you a thing or two!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming soon for PC!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945720?t=1756846917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756846917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app